  "Input is reported input; unknown is not zero. Cache ratios use compatible prompt-token denominators, separately by provider.": "输入为服务商报告的输入；未知不等于零。缓存比例按服务商分别计算，且只使用兼容的提示词 token 分母。",
  "Request and turn scopes include attributable attempts only. Unlinked memory, steward, checkpoint, handoff and child overhead remain in Session or Bot totals. Scopes overlap; do not add them together.": "请求和轮次只计入可归属的调用。未关联的记忆、上下文管家、检查点、交接和子任务开销保留在会话或 Bot 总计中。各范围有重叠，请勿相加。",
  "Accounting refresh in progress; totals may be incomplete.": "正在刷新统计，总计可能尚不完整。",
