  "Tokens and attempts only. Cache efficiency is not task success; no cost, timing or native-DSH effectiveness comparison is inferred.": "只统计 token 和调用尝试。缓存效率不代表任务成功，也不推断费用、耗时或与原生 DSH 的效果对比。",
