  "Recent-message carry budget": "最近消息保留预算",
  "Token budget for protected recent messages in checkpoints and handoffs; the effective budget is also capped by the check line.": "检查点与交接中保留最近消息的 token 预算；实际预算也受检查阈值限制。",
