  "Start new part carries nothing from this part. Earlier history remains searchable. Click Confirm new part to continue.": "新部分不会携带本部分内容。旧历史仍可搜索。点击“确认开始新部分”继续。",
  "Checkpoint now condenses this part while keeping protected recent messages. Start new part is separate and carries nothing. Native manual compaction is unavailable for Bot-managed Sessions.": "立即创建检查点会压缩本部分，并保留受保护的最近消息。开始新部分是独立操作，不携带旧内容。Bot 管理的会话不支持原生手动压缩。",
  "Memory review": "记忆审核",
  "Automatic memory review": "自动记忆审核",
  "Reviews this Bot’s own chat after idle turns. Independent of context compaction; no fixed ordering is promised.": "在空闲轮次后审核此 Bot 的私聊。与上下文压缩独立，不保证固定顺序。",
