  "Your channels and their chats": "你的频道和其中的聊天",
  "The only Main Bot. To hand the role to another Bot, use Main Bot on the Bots page.": "这是唯一的主 Bot。要把主 Bot 交给别的 Bot，请到「Bot」页的主 Bot 里换。",
