  "Share my chats with DeepSeek to improve their models": "与 DeepSeek 分享我的对话，帮助改进他们的模型",
  "DeepSeek (api.deepseek.com)": "DeepSeek（api.deepseek.com）",
  "With every request to a DeepSeek model: the whole chat so far (your messages, the Bot's replies, tool results), the folder it works in, and the list of plugins you have installed.": "每次向 DeepSeek 模型发送请求时：到目前为止的整段对话（你的消息、Bot 的回复、工具结果）、它工作的文件夹，以及你安装的插件列表。",
  "Send a chat to DeepSeek when I rate a reply": "我给回复评分时，把对话发送给 DeepSeek",
  "DeepSeek's telemetry service (dsh-otel-collector.deepseeksvc.com)": "DeepSeek 的遥测服务（dsh-otel-collector.deepseeksvc.com）",
  "When you rate a message or use /feedback: the whole chat, with an anonymous id, the app's version and your rating, whatever model the chat used.": "当你给消息评分或使用 /feedback 时：整段对话、一个匿名 id、应用版本和你的评分，无论对话用的是哪个模型。",
  "Send Claude Code's error reports to Anthropic": "把 Claude Code 的错误报告发送给 Anthropic",
  "Anthropic": "Anthropic",
  "When Claude Code runs into an error: what went wrong, the Claude Code version and your system. Also lets Claude Code check for its own updates.": "当 Claude Code 出错时：出了什么问题、Claude Code 的版本和你的系统。也允许 Claude Code 检查自己的更新。",
  "Download spellcheck dictionaries": "下载拼写检查词典",
  "Google": "Google",
  "On Linux and Windows: a request for your language's dictionary, which tells Google your language and network address, never your text. On a Mac spelling is checked locally, so this changes nothing there.": "在 Linux 和 Windows 上：请求你所用语言的词典，这会让 Google 知道你的语言和网络地址，但绝不会知道你的文字。在 Mac 上拼写检查在本地完成，所以这里没有变化。",
  "Keep the same anonymous id for DeepSeek": "对 DeepSeek 保持同一个匿名 id",
  "DeepSeek requests always carry an anonymous id, which no setting removes. It stays the same across launches, as in DSH. Switched off, Automagik makes a new one every time it starts; DeepSeek still knows your account from your key or sign-in.": "DeepSeek 请求总会带一个匿名 id，没有设置可以去掉它。它在多次启动之间保持不变，和 DSH 一样。关闭后，Automagik 每次启动都会换一个新的；DeepSeek 仍然能从你的密钥或登录知道你的账号。",
